DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       sstt44ttooppggmm  reads  an  image  file in the native format used by the Santa
       Barbara Instrument Group (SBIG) ST-4 astronomical CCD cameras, and pro‐
       duces  a  PGM  image as output.  This format is not to be confused with
       the format most other SBIG cameras use, for which  you  can  use  ssbbiigg‐‐
       ttooppggmm.

       Additional  information  on  SBIG cameras and documentation of the file
       format   is   available   at   the   Web   site,   http://www.sbig.com/
       ⟨http://www.sbig.com/⟩ .



OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       There  are  no  command line options defined specifically for sstt44ttooppggmm,
       but it recognizes the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (See
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ .)


